@startuml agentic-culture-realization
title Agentic Culture Realization ; per ADR-ES-023 section 6 + CR-ES-023 section 10

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Organizational Values / Norms;
:Delegation Expectations;
:Authority & Accountability Norms;
:Human / Agent Interaction Norms;
:Decision & Coordination Practices;
:Adaptive Behavior;
:Learning / Reinforcement;
:evolving Organizational Culture;
stop

note right
  Per ADR-ES-023 section 6 ; descriptive pattern
  rather than mandatory process model.
end note

@enduml
